# turn 2. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Flametongue Kavu (its enters trigger aims 4 damage at one of Bot2's Ornithopters), taps the Ornithopter and
# the summoning-sick Kavu to pay for Kirol's ability and copies the trigger with the other Ornithopter as its target: both die.

